  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Gold_Lure?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a8/Gold_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330230009\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Purple lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"240\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Purple lure</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  30 mins</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure Workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>&#160;?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25 mins</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Gold lures</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27. They are used to lure <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>.\n</p><p>They are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tackle box</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making gold lures</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0a/Lure_Workbench.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925185602\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lure Workbench\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Lure Workbench</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Gold lures are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a>.\n</p><p>To make a gold lure, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantity:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6e/Golden_Voucher.png/revision/latest?cb=20160312141538\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Golden Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Golden Voucher\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 30 minutes to make one lure, and 25 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> machine. Each lure gives players 5 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Using gold lures</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Note: The color below fish is an alternative lure color that can catch the fish. Fish labelled with <span>★★★</span> can only be caught during fishing events.</li></ul>\n<p>Gold lures can fish the following <a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6a/Yellow_Perch.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711154130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yellow Perch\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a2/Bluegill.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711131150\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bluegill\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0f/Asp.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711130401\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Asp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f5/Speckled_Dace.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711153707\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Speckled Dace\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/yellow-perch-10651\" title=\"Yellow Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yellow Perch</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/bluegill-10654\" title=\"Bluegill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bluegill</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/asp-10866\" title=\"Asp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Asp</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/speckled-dace-11255\" title=\"Speckled Dace\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Speckled Dace</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Blue\n</td>\n<td>Purple\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0b/Northern_Pike.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711150944\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Northern Pike\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/65/Arctic_Charr.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711130400\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Arctic Charr\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/61/Rudd.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711152953\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rudd\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9e/Yellow_Bass.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711154130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Yellow Bass\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/northern-pike-11030\" title=\"Northern Pike\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Northern Pike</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/arctic-charr-11443\" title=\"Arctic Charr\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Arctic Charr</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/rudd-11029\" title=\"Rudd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rudd</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/yellow-bass-11061\" title=\"Yellow Bass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yellow Bass</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Purple\n</td>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Blue\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/60/Greater_Redhorse.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711144910\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Greater Redhorse\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6b/Golden_Trout.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711132306\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Golden Trout\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/90/Green_Sunfish.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711144910\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Sunfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f2/Zander.png/revision/latest?cb=20150711154130\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Zander\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/greater-redhorse-11435\" title=\"Greater Redhorse\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greater Redhorse</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/golden-trout-11228\" title=\"Golden Trout\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Trout</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/green-sunfish-10103\" title=\"Green Sunfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Green Sunfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/zander-11028\" title=\"Zander\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Zander</a></b>\n<p><span>★★★</span><br>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Purple\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Green\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/nile-perch-11452\" title=\"Nile Perch\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nile Perch\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/white-catfish-11454\" title=\"White Catfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"White Catfish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/lake-whitefish-17220\" title=\"Lake Whitefish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lake Whitefish\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/carp-11437\" title=\"Carp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Carp</a></b>\n<p><span>★★★</span><br>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/black-bullhead-11455\" title=\"Black Bullhead\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Black Bullhead</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/goldfish-11456\" title=\"Goldfish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Goldfish</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>Green\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Lures cannot be bought or sold in the roadside shop, but can be traded between <a href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" title=\"Neighborhood\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighbors</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Truck</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> never ask for lures.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\">Trivia</span></h3>\n<ul><li>The Gold Lure is the only item that requires a gold voucher to make.</li>\n<li>Using a glitch related to having multiple farms, it is actually possible to get purple lures before level 27 using Neighborhood Requests. By playing on a farm that is Level 27 or higher, select the Tackle Box tab on the Neighborhood Requests screen. Then, switch to a farm between levels 12 and 26, and open Neighborhood Requests, and you will be on the (invisible) Tackle Box tab, where you can then request purple lures.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-lure-workbench-products-29469\" title=\"Category:Lure Workbench Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-lure-30470\" title=\"Blue Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/gold-lure-33410\" title=\"Gold Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gold Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/green-lure-30469\" title=\"Green Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/purple-lure-33409\" title=\"Purple Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/red-lure-30467\" title=\"Red Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901030527\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.102 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 768/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3793/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 724/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 771762/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.830      1 -total\n 72.68%   41.306      1 Template:Infobox\n 34.03%   19.339      4 Template:Infoicon\n 20.53%   11.668      1 Template:Navigation\n 12.70%    7.216      1 Template:LureWorkbenchMenu\n  2.33%    1.325      1 Template:Languages\n  2.07%    1.174      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  1.82%    1.036      2 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:33410-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901030527 and revision id 108070. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
